{"title":"0804.3678 Causal inference using the algorithmic Markov condition","markdown":{"headingText":"0804.3678 Causal inference using the algorithmic Markov condition","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"- 作者/日期/来源：Dominik Janzing, Bernhard Schölkopf / 2008-04-23 / arXiv:0804.3678\n- **一句话定位**：把因果马尔可夫条件（causal Markov condition, CMC）从统计独立性推广为基于柯尔莫哥洛夫复杂性（Kolmogorov complexity）的算法独立性，从而建立一套无需重复采样、可对单个对象做因果推断的理论。\n- **研究问题**：传统基于约束的因果推断依赖 i.i.d. 采样与条件独立性检验，存在两大局限：无法区分马尔可夫等价（Markov equivalent）的图；无法处理单次观测（如两篇文本、两个基因组序列）之间的因果关联。本文问：能否用算法信息论统一并超越统计因果推断。\n- **模型与方法**：观测对象为二进制串 x1,…,xn 而非随机变量，独立性定义为条件算法互信息为零：I(x:y|z)=0（依 Definition 4 采用显著性阈值）。Postulate 5（算法因果马尔可夫条件）：xj ⊥ ndj | pa*_j，即在给定父节点的最优联合压缩下，节点与非后代算法独立。Postulate 6（算法因果模型）：每个 xj = qj(pa_j, n_j) 由 O(1) 长度程序从父节点与额外输入计算，且各 n_j 联合算法独立。Postulate 7（统计性质的算法独立性）：因果假设可接受当且仅当 K(P(X1,…,Xn)) =⁺ Σ_j K(P(Xj|PA_j))，即联合分布的最短描述由各马尔可夫核的最短描述拼接而成；其右端称为模型的总复杂度。\n- **主要命题/定理**：Theorem 3 证明算法情形下递归形式（K(x1,…,xn) ≈ Σ K(xj|pa*_j)）、局部与全局（d-分离 ⇒ 算法独立）三种马尔可夫条件等价，平行于统计情形的 Lauritzen 引理。Theorem 4 证明 Postulate 6 的算法函数模型蕴含算法马尔可夫条件（证明仿 Pearl 功能模型引理的扩展图论证）。Lemma 5 给出算法版共同原因原理：I(x:y)≫0 蕴含共同过去。作为 Postulate 7 的应用，文中对二值 X 与连续 Y 的双高斯混合例子证明 X→Y 可接受而 Y→X 被拒绝：反向条件 P(X=1|y)=½[1+tanh(λ(y−µ)/σ²)] 与边缘 P(Y) 共享参数，I(P(Y):P(X|Y)) =⁺ K(µ)+K(λ/σ²) > 0，即机制间存在非典型的算法依赖；这为早先\"合理马尔可夫核\"启发式（选总复杂度 Σ C(P(Xj|PAj)) 最小的图）提供理论基础，且蕴含 faithfulness（Postulate 3）。文中还讨论用资源受限复杂性等可判定量替代不可计算的 K。\n- **在因果研究脉络中的角色**：Schölkopf 组\"因果推断的算法化\"纲领的奠基性长文，首次把\"原因与机制的独立性\"精确表述为算法独立性（Postulate 7），是后来独立机制（independent causal mechanisms, ICM）原理与信息几何因果推断的直接源头，也通过可压缩性思想启发了基于压缩的实用因果推断（如后续 1002.4020）。\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","output-file":"0804.3678.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"目录","toc-title-website":"该页面内容","related-formats-title":"其他格式","related-notebooks-title":"笔记本","source-notebooks-prefix":"资源","other-links-title":"其他链接","code-links-title":"代码链接","launch-dev-container-title":"启动 Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"启动 Binder","article-notebook-label":"文章笔记本","notebook-preview-download":"下载笔记本","notebook-preview-download-src":"下载源代码","notebook-preview-back":"返回文章","manuscript-meca-bundle":"MECA 存档","section-title-abstract":"摘要","section-title-appendices":"附录","section-title-footnotes":"脚注","section-title-references":"参考文献","section-title-reuse":"二次使用","section-title-copyright":"版权","section-title-citation":"引用格式","appendix-attribution-cite-as":"请按如下格式引用：","appendix-attribution-bibtex":"BibTeX","appendix-view-license":"查看许可协议","title-block-author-single":"作者","title-block-author-plural":"作者","title-block-affiliation-single":"单位","title-block-affiliation-plural":"单位","title-block-published":"发布于","title-block-modified":"修